{"name":"Fortitude","hex":"#c6c5c1","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"fortitude","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Mental or emotional strength that enables courage in the face of adversity.","Physical strength."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/fortitude"}],"entries":[{"title":"Courage","blocks":[{"text":"Courage is the choice and willingness to confront agony, pain, danger, uncertainty, or intimidation. Valour is courage or bravery, especially in battle."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Plate_7_from_%22The_Disasters_of_War%27_%28Los_Desastres_de_la_Guerra%29-_What_courage%21_%28Que_valor%21%29_MET_MM13446.jpg/330px-Plate_7_from_%22The_Disasters_of_War%27_%28Los_Desastres_de_la_Guerra%29-_What_courage%21_%28Que_valor%21%29_MET_MM13446.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Courage","wikidata":"Q208160"},{"title":"HMS Fortitude","blocks":[{"text":"Two ships and a shore establishment of the Royal Navy have borne the name HMS Fortitude:"}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HMS_Fortitude","wikidata":"Q4040093"},{"title":"Fortitude (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Fortitude is a British horror psychological thriller television series created and written by Simon Donald. A 12-episode season was commissioned by Sky Atlantic in 2013, and started airing on 29 January 2015. The series is set in the fictional Arctic Norwegian settlement of Fortitude. On 9 April 2015, Sky Atlantic recommissioned the show for a second season consisting of 10 episodes, which premiered on 26 January 2017. The third and final season premiered on 6 December 2018 and concluded on 27 December, consisting of 4 episodes."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d1/Fortitude-titlecard.jpg/330px-Fortitude-titlecard.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/For